# v294 — ENGAGEMENT PREPARATION QUEUE
# The release whose production absence caused the PGRST202 outage. Its migration
# reached ec and was certified there; it never reached production, and no gate
# looked. This manifest is the gate that would have caught it.
release          v294
migration        supabase/v294_preparation_queue.sql
migration_source repository
min_release      v293

function         projection_preparation_queue(p_now timestamp with time zone)
